reference.api:
```
WebSocket (per device)
  C→S  send   {client_msg_id, conv_id, ciphertexts[{device_id, blob}]}
  S→C  ack    {client_msg_id, server_msg_id, seq}
  S→C  deliver {conv_id, seq, sender, blob}      C→S  ack {conv_id, seq}
  C→S  receipt {conv_id, upto_seq, type: delivered|read}
HTTP: POST /keys (upload key bundle), GET /keys/{user} (fetch prekeys), POST /media
```
- `client_msg_id` is the idempotency key: a retry after a dropped ack returns the same `server_msg_id`.
- Large media is uploaded encrypted to blob storage; the message carries the key and URL.
